- Story & Context: Silas found the old survey map in a flooded basement near the Chicago River, noting a border that didn't exist on any modern grid. When he tried to transcribe the coordinates into a sequence, he felt his own heartbeat sync with the hum of the cooling pipes, realizing the city was hiding a migration route beneath the asphalt. "The compass needle is shivering like a trapped bird."
